examples and optional implementation recipes of juliobsz/skills, commit
f193f6745aae738e9d54a0ca28792822e4777a63. Copyright (c) 2026 Julio (juliobsz).
MIT License is included as LICENSE.juliobsz-skills. The existing Impeccable and
Motionmaxxing licence notices above retain their own scopes.

Local path, owner, historical-status and recipe clarifications are recorded in
references/awwwards-adaptations.json with source/output hashes. The 19 text
sources map to 18 references by deduplicating the generated quality-bar copy.
